<app-shell tabs="{{tabs}}" title="个人中心" tab="profile"><view class="profile-heading"><view class="profile-symbol"><ui-icon name="user-round" size="50" /></view><view><text class="profile-title">{{signed ? '我的美好社区' : '欢迎，邻居'}}</text><text class="xp-caption">{{signed ? '微信账号已登录' : '登录后管理你的房屋服务'}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{!signed}}" class="xp-actions"><button class="xp-button" bindtap="login">微信一键登录</button></view><view class="profile-services"><button bindtap="houses"><view class="profile-service-icon yellow"><ui-icon name="house" size="42" /></view><text>我的房屋</text></button><button bindtap="orders"><view class="profile-service-icon blue"><ui-icon name="receipt-text" size="42" /></view><text>我的缴费</text></button><button bindtap="claims"><view class="profile-service-icon peach"><ui-icon name="clipboard-list" size="42" /></view><text>我的申请</text></button></view><view class="xp-card profile-menu"><button bindtap="identities"><ui-icon name="user-round" size="40" /><text>选择身份</text><view class="profile-end"><ui-icon name="chevron-right" size="30" /></view></button><button bindtap="phones"><ui-icon name="smartphone" size="40" /><text>手机号管理</text><view class="profile-end"><text>{{signed ? phoneError ? '点击查看' : phoneCount + ' 个号码' : ''}}</text><ui-icon name="chevron-right" size="30" /></view></button><button bindtap="help"><ui-icon name="circle-help" size="40" /><text>服务说明</text><view class="profile-end"><ui-icon name="chevron-right" size="30" /></view></button><button bindtap="about"><ui-icon name="info" size="40" /><text>关于美好社区</text><view class="profile-end"><ui-icon name="chevron-right" size="30" /></view></button></view><view wx:if="{{signed}}" class="xp-actions"><button class="xp-button xp-neutral" bindtap="exit">退出登录</button></view><text class="xp-legal profile-signature">安心相邻 · 简单生活</text></app-shell>
<bottom-sheet hide-cancel="{{sheet !== 'logout'}}" show="{{!!sheet}}" title="{{sheet === 'logout' ? '退出当前账号？' : sheet === 'about' ? '关于美好社区' : '服务说明'}}" confirm-text="{{sheet === 'logout' ? '确认退出' : '知道了'}}" cancel-text="{{sheet === 'logout' ? '暂不退出' : ''}}" busy="{{busy}}" bindconfirm="confirm" bindclose="close"><text wx:if="{{sheet === 'logout'}}" class="xp-muted">退出后需重新微信登录，已提交的申请和本人缴费记录仍会保留。</text><text wx:elif="{{sheet === 'about'}}" class="xp-muted">美好社区，为居民提供房屋认领、物业账单与本人缴费记录服务。让每一笔缴费，都清清楚楚。</text><view wx:else class="profile-help"><text>房屋认领需物业人工审核。每次缴纳一张账单的全部余款；手机号验证不代表房屋所有权。</text></view><view wx:if="{{sheet === 'about'}}" class="xp-caption">版本 {{version}}</view><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="xp-field-error">{{error}}</text></bottom-sheet>
